WEBVTT

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.340
Darn them! Why couldn't Shino and Sosuke

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.900
send word if they had to be out so late?

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.760
If you're worried, should I send
the Goko Five Foxes after them?

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.900
I'm fine! It's not like I'm worried.

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:18.740
Oh, yes, Hamaji.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.510
Would you like to
check out a school tomorrow?

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.880
Huh? A school?

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.920
It looks like Shii and Sosuke
will be staying here for a while.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.440
In which case, won't you
need to attend school?

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:35.600
Bro!

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:36.740
Damn it!

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.380
Where the hell did he go?

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:44.650
Sosuke!

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:54.790
So!

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:55.880
I am fine.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:59.010
The wound is not terribly deep.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.670
Murasame, go inform Satomi!

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.450
Roger!

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.970
Try not to move, Sosuke.

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:06.980
Right.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.970
But still, I never expected this
to make itself useful.

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:15.420
Wh-what the heck?!

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:17.560
It was inside of your pocket.

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:20.070
Don't go inside of my clothes!

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:23.510
Who's that?

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:26.030
I believe he would be the demon.

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:27.250
The demon?!

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:29.540
That was him?

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:04.770
Don't you dare allow that
demon and child to escape!

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:06.770
Homecoming

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:06.710
We must find them!

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:10.120
The same goes for that sword.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.860
That was the legendary
demon sword, Murasame.

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:17.250
Why was it with such a young child?

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:30.690
Sosuke...

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:36.150
Sosuke was all on his own,
lacking both a mother and a father.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.650
Sosuke didn't cling to anything.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.270
Not even his own life...

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.190
So when that came to pass,

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:49.720
I was the one who forced Sosuke's soul
to stay in this world.

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:56.420
Shino, won't you catch a cold
if you sleep down there?

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:57.710
Sosuke!

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.810
Thank God, Sosuke!

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.480
Ow, that hurts! You're killing me.
Thank God, Sosuke!

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:02.680
Ow, that hurts! You're killing me.
Glomp, glomp!

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:11.380
Open! Open up!

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:14.930
Hey, Shino! Breakfast is...

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.290
Gosh darn it!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:30.140
That eyeball is freaky enough
without throwing a dog spirit in the mix!

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.680
You have some unique friends...

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.180
But hey, it's cool. Now eat up.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.640
Thanks for the meal!

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:37.840
Thank you very much.

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:42.570
Ya know, if you said
that's actually Sosuke,

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.690
I don't think it'd surprise
me anymore. Yeah...

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:46.450
Thank you for taking care of us.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.020
How's that demon doing?

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.750
He's still asleep.

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:54.950
He really put you out, didn't he?

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.060
I'll see to it that he apologizes later.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:02.480
And speaking of the devil, here he is!

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:07.880
Good morning.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.250
'Morning! 'Morning.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:16.000
By any chance, am I still asleep?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.240
No, this ain't a dream!

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:23.390
A flower-shaped birthmark.
Isn't that just like...?

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:27.440
Bro, do you remember
what happened yesterday?

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.940
Are you referring to those
rotten Shogetsu monks?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:33.080
Man, you're awful!

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.140
Yesterday ya kept goin'
on about stuffin' yer face

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.270
and chased after this here kid.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.990
Are you also a spirit of some sort?

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:44.260
You have done an excellent job

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.780
disguising yourself as a human child.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.790
I've always been human!

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.360
Then why is a dog spirit with you?

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:55.390
Are you one of Satomi's pet spirits?

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:58.570
Don't make me repeat
myself! I'm just like you.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:01.410
I'm just a normal person.

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:06.960
Didn't you...

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.470
see the form that I took on yesterday?

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.350
I saw you.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.510
Appearance is not what determines
whether or not you are human.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:17.910
Don't be deceived.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:26.480
Well, breakfast is getting
cold! Let's chow down.

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:36.110
I will pretend I didn't see that...

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:41.180
But, dang, he sure was quick to recover
after taking all those hits.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.480
That's how he's built.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.910
I guess I could tell you...

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:51.730
Do you remember the
hostage incident that

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:53.470
occurred up north three years ago?

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:55.030
Nope!

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:58.500
There was an incident where
bandits from the northern

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.750
neighboring country took some villagers as hostages.

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.230
Hmmm.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:04.490
Were you involved in this incident?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:09.780
Yeah. Genpachi was sent to handle things
as the commanding officer.

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:13.280
I accompanied him as a foot soldier.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.590
It was supposed to be over quick.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:22.510
Unfortunately, one of the hostages
was a royal named Princess Sai.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.820
The battle dragged out much
longer than anticipated.

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:28.870
Eventually, winter came.

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:31.580
There were deserters right and left
due to the cold and starvation.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.400
The village was in shambles.

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:39.140
Then the man-eating demons showed up...

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:50.120
I am certain that we died back there.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:55.790
But Genpachi and I
desperately wanted to live.

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:02.160
HARMONY
TRUST

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:08.870
I don't remember much of that snowy day,

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.470
not even how we were saved...

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:15.750
This is my older sister, Nui.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.050
She was Genpachi's fiancée.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:25.590
We desperately fought to come back home.

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:27.230
But...

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:30.330
...my big sis had passed away.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:39.250
It drove Genpachi half mad.

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.110
When I took my eyes off of him...

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:44.620
...he slit his own throat.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.550
But the wound quickly healed.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:05.600
He tried to kill himself again and again,
but he couldn't die.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.990
"Something isn't right..."

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:27.030
Without our realizing it,
our bodies had become immortal.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:30.570
What the hell happened
on that snowy day?

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.050
What happened to the others?

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:39.410
Everyone died.

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:44.280
Princess Sai was the only one
that made it out unscathed.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.870
Supposedly Rio Satomi and
his dog spirit showed up

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:50.010
and settled the matter in mere moments.

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:55.760
If he could handle it on his own,

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.690
you shoulda sent him to begin with.

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:00.670
Like the Army's gonna ask
the Church for a favor!

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:04.770
After the royals went cryin' to them,
the great Satomi showed up!

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:08.640
That's the end of my story.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:11.510
And now it's your turn.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.760
Shino, why are those damn monks

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:17.250
searchin' for you and not just Genpachi?

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:20.950
Eh? Uh, well...

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.260
I guess this would be
what they're after, huh?

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:25.980
This must be it.

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:26.990
What?

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:31.980
Murasame...

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:34.780
It is not for men to touch.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.990
Where did you hear its name?

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.380
Abbot, I have merely
heard trivial rumors

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:44.120
floating about ever since it vanished.

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:47.460
I thought that perhaps you might know
of its location, Abbot Myoko.

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:52.130
Does such worldly nonsense
pique your interest, Seiran?

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.200
I am terribly sorry.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:04.000
Even I do not know of
Murasame's whereabouts.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:08.500
But it is not something
you could hope to wield.

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:13.200
Not when you are inferior
to your pathetic younger brother.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:25.170
I'm glad to hear that
Shii and Sosuke are okay.

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:28.270
But to think that they got
mixed up with the survivors

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:29.850
from that northern incident three years ago.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:33.310
I think their meeting was inevitable.

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:39.130
Shino Inuzuka, Sosuke Inukawa,
Genpachi Inukai and Kobungo Inuta...

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.860
Come to think of it, until now,

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.180
didn't the Satomi family's dog spirit
always choose a female?

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.790
Why did it choose you this time around
when you're a man?

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.300
I don't know. Ask Yatsufusa.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:54.810
Easy for you to say.

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:58.580
How am I supposed to
communicate with it?

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:04.520
Kaname, if there is something
you wish to ask Yatsufusa,

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:07.280
you may leave that task to us.

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:10.900
It is true that the Satomi ladies have

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:13.460
performed an important
role as priestesses.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:16.250
I find this most puzzling myself.

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:19.460
Yatsufusa, was there some deep reason
behind this decision?

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:21.540
Yatsufusa?

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:30.220
What is it?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.400
Well, you have a point...

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.910
It is truly important.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:38.230
So what was its reasoning?

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.740
I think it's smaller now...

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:45.980
Hungry?

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.890
What're you doing?

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:58.500
Well, I just saw the secrets of life...

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.000
Hey, Bro...?

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:02.190
What is it?

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:06.510
When we first died, what
ran through your head?

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:12.750
I thought about Nui, my dad, you,

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:15.290
the innkeeper and Old Man Inuta.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.740
About all of the people
who were waiting for me.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:20.860
You?

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:22.390
Same for me.

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:26.310
I desperately told myself
I didn't want to die.

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:29.910
I just wanted to return to
the people waiting for me.

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:32.410
That's all I yearned for...

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:42.160
Ya know, they're sole
survivors themselves.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:44.620
Otsuka Village.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.960
Didn't a disease wipe
out the entire village?

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:52.540
The two of them and their childhood friend
were the only survivors.

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:57.570
Jeez, they're sleeping like babes!

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.270
Did you see enough?

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:19.460
Yes, but it was filled with
nothing but proper ladies.

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:22.350
I think that you are
perfectly well mannered.

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:25.700
Thank you, but I'm not as poised as you.

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:27.150
Hardly!

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:31.070
I did not learn how to hold
my chopsticks correctly

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:33.220
until the Church took me in.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:36.030
Those foxes are the ones who taught me

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:37.480
how to properly speak and write.

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:41.990
They love you, don't they?

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.850
The Goko Five Foxes will
do anything they can to

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:47.990
protect me and only me,
regardless of what I may want.

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:52.840
Some members of the Osaki family
tried to take my life once.

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:53.500
What?!

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:57.190
I was impressed over how
enraged it made the foxes.

00:14:57.970 --> 00:15:01.000
People died and part
of the house collapsed.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:04.310
And here they're so cute...

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:10.470
Hamaji!

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.780
Are you all right? Let me take a look.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:15.220
That hurt!

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.010
Ginko!

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:20.450
Understood!

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:27.110
Damn it!

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:31.610
Until now, I had no interest
in what that man did.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:36.460
Tch! The cursed wretch!

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:38.370
How are the preparations
for the demon hunt proceeding?

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:41.480
Abbot Myoko has still not
given his permission.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:44.760
We do not need it.

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:53.510
He is no longer capable
of any form of thought.

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:04.920
Here, eat it.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.530
Was that good, Megu?

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:10.780
Megu?!

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.770
"A Murky Eyeball that is
somewhat Gross and Ugly."

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:15.960
Or "Megu" for short.

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:17.960
You've named it!

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.770
You have formed
quite a bond with it, haven't you?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:22.410
Let's just leave the thing here.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.540
No, I insist that you take it with you!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:32.420
Bro!

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:34.940
Murasame!

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:43.410
They've got us totally surrounded.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:55.320
I swear, this world was designed
so that there is never a dull moment.

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.440
It is better than nothing! Use it!

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:00.450
Here they come!

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:08.130
Hurry! Out through the back
before the fire spreads!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.610
I see that you survived.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:23.900
Seiran!

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:27.900
Genpachi, you survived
the northern battlefront.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.670
Nui must have been absolutely terrified.

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:34.670
After all, the man she had believed
to be dead was coming back.

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:37.660
Oh, didn't you know?

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:41.090
I can see that those around
you were unable to tell you.

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:43.050
Don't say it, Seiran!

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:48.420
Nui was with child, but did not know
who the father was.

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:53.490
The day that she learned
you were returning from the north,

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:57.550
she jumped into the river,
consumed by her guilty conscience.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:10.610
If you never came back,
Nui would not have died.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:14.320
Seiran, you bastard!

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:47.940
I didn't expect him to be so powerful...
We're pulling back!

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:49.750
Father Seiran, this way.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:53.810
Goodness! Are you going to
retreat after coming so far?

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:58.770
Who's there?

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:01.570
"Who am I," you ask?

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:04.830
I have no business with fools
who don't even know that.

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:11.390
Osaki...

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:18.230
Accursed child, what brought you here?

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.210
Are you okay with your arm like that?

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.390
If you don't tend to
it soon, you will die.

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:25.490
That is none of your concern!

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:29.450
My bug familiars will mend this wound-

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:30.570
I doubt it.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.950
Not so much as a single bug
has returned to your side.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.170
What...?!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.100
Hey, did you know?

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:43.120
I never did hate you.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:47.790
Even when your mother tried
to kill me, a bastard child,

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:50.610
I merely felt sorry for the lot of you.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:56.550
But truly, injuring a girl's face
is crossing the line, isn't it?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:59.900
Wouldn't you agree, my big brother?

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:11.640
Genpachi... Kobungo...!

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:14.700
We have to extinguish the fire
before it spreads across the mountain.

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:15.460
Yeah!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:19.310
Murasame, show me the power
implied by your name!

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:48.400
Are you upset about Sis?

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:50.150
No...

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.710
I just wish you had told me the truth.

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:57.870
There was no way I could tell someone

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:59.550
who kept trying to follow after her!

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:02.900
You two are just alike.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.330
You're both weak and try
to take the easy way out.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.770
That's why everyone
tried to protect you...

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.970
Yeah, I know.

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:20.550
This time you should
pick a strong-willed

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.920
chick that seems practically immortal!

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:26.110
The only woman I know like that
is the Kona-ya's innkeeper.

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:28.300
Hey, you alive?

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:37.040
Genpachi? You okay?

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:39.410
I found one.

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:43.520
Someone who is strong willed and
seems practically immortal.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.110
Now that I take a closer look,
you're definitely my type...

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:50.710
In another five or six years...

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:56.080
Hey, Bro! That's a dude!

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:41.020
Divine Blessings

00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:29.020
Bro, please come to your senses!

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:30.020
What is the problem?

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:32.440
That's a guy! And he's still a kid!

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:34.600
The girls are all over you
when you keep your mouth shut.

00:23:34.600 --> 00:23:37.600
It's okay! I'll save up
my money for Shino and

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:38.860
become a financially stable man.

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:40.120
He's totally lost it...
